OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation ending on
OL,4,Acontroversial Rosebank oil field
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters and opponents of the
OL,7,Fcontroversial Rosebank oil field have
OL,8,Fbeen making their cases as a
OL,9,Fconsultation on the plans draws to a
OL,10,Fclose.
OL,12,FThe industry regulator is considering
OL,13,Frevised applications for the #8.7bn
OL,14,Fproject off Shetland and the Jackdaw
OL,15,Fgas field after a court ruled that they
OL,16,Fhad been unlawfully approved.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
