OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation ending on
OL,4,Acontroversial Rosebank oil field
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental campaign group Uplift,
OL,7,Fwhich was behind the successful legal
OL,8,Fchallenge, argues that recent extreme
OL,9,Fheatwaves and wildfires are evidence
OL,10,Fthat more drilling will "wreck the
OL,11,Fplanet"
OL,13,FBut the boss of oil company Adura, CEO
OL,14,FNeil McCulloch, says fossil fuels will
OL,15,Fbe needed for years to come and that
OL,16,Fproducing them domestically will
OL,17,Fgenerate billions in tax revenues.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
